  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a continuation and expansion of IOM&#x2019;s Missing Migrants Project for 2026, focusing on ensuring timely, accurate data and analysis on deaths and disappearances during migration. Key outputs are the continuous updating of the global database on incidents involving migrant deaths, and analysis of data to estimate the true scale of the issue.</narrative>
